import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const v=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 576 | Acceleration Domain | Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Multi-Universe Stewardship","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 576 | Acceleration Domain | Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Multi-Universe Stewardship","no":576,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Multiverse Realm","Multi-Universe Stewardship","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","80-Plane Theory and Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0576_模块3-加速域-多元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0576_模块3-加速域-多元境适配.md"}'),a={name:"en/0576_模块3-加速域-多元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-576-acceleration-domain-multiverse-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-multi-universe-stewardship" tabindex="-1">Entry 576 | Acceleration Domain | Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Multi-Universe Stewardship <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-576-acceleration-domain-multiverse-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-multi-universe-stewardship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 576 | Acceleration Domain | Multiverse Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Multi-Universe Stewardship&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 80; Benchmark library: Entry 575</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-cultivator-steps-out-of-his-own-universe" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the cultivator steps out of his own universe <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-cultivator-steps-out-of-his-own-universe" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the cultivator steps out of his own universe&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Above Origin Realm lies the extended-setting Multiverse Realm (pending terminology-committee calibration). The Origin cultivator already resonates with a single universe&#39;s origin; Multiverse requires his consciousness to <strong>step out of a single universe and simultaneously establish resonance with multiple universes&#39; origins</strong> (Document 98 extended-setting proposal list). A cultivator at this realm is no longer &quot;the transcendent strong one of some universe,&quot; but <strong>a multi-universe-level being</strong> — his consciousness may simultaneously cover hundreds, thousands of universes; his decisions affect multiple universes&#39; operation.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in Multiverse enter the hyper-multiverse stage: anti-predation axiom requires multi-universe stewardship be not &quot;annexing other universes,&quot; but &quot;coordinating multiple universes&quot;; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the Multiverse cultivator represent all universes&#39; Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires multi-universe coordination ultimately point to all universes&#39; shared ascension; causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-universe operations supervised to the extreme; law-first axiom takes &quot;Multiverse adapted flow&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-multi-universe-stewardship-needs-distributed-acceleration" tabindex="-1">I. Why Multi-Universe Stewardship Needs &quot;Distributed Acceleration&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-multi-universe-stewardship-needs-distributed-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Multi-Universe Stewardship Needs &quot;Distributed Acceleration&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Multiverse cultivator faces not a single time-flow problem, but a <strong>multi-universe time-flow coordination</strong> problem. Each universe has its own time flow, its own causal texture, its own Myriad-Rank civilization. If a Multiverse cultivator forcibly &quot;stewards&quot; all universes with a single flow, inevitably leads to:</p><ul><li>Some universes dragged too fast into his rhythm, causal overheating;</li><li>Some universes left too slow in place, development stagnant;</li><li>His consciousness torn in cross-universe resonance.</li></ul><p>Thus Multiverse acceleration gear&#39;s design principle is <strong>distributed acceleration</strong>: not giving the cultivator a unified high-multiple flow, but letting him individually configure flow gears for each universe, then use the Alaya Network to coordinate these gears.</p><h2 id="ii-multiverse-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Multiverse Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-multiverse-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Multiverse Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Single-Universe Flow Cap</td><td>1000×</td><td>Same as Origin Realm, not relaxed for multi-universe</td></tr><tr><td>Parallel Universes</td><td>Simultaneously coordinate 11–99</td><td>More than 99 splits consciousness</td></tr><tr><td>Flow-Difference Cap</td><td>Between coordinated universes flow difference ≤ 10×</td><td>Prevent causal fracture</td></tr><tr><td>Coordination Approval</td><td>Each newly added universe needs Anchor Council approval</td><td>Prevent infinite expansion</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Hearing</td><td>Any flow adjustment over 100× needs hearing</td><td>Cross-universe operations extremely sensitive</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s core is &quot;single universe not relaxed, parallel has cap, difference has boundary.&quot; The Multiverse cultivator&#39;s strength lies not in how fast he can make one universe run, but in how many universes he can move forward in a <strong>compatible rhythm</strong>.</p><h2 id="iii-multi-universe-coordination-s-myriad-rank-representative-system" tabindex="-1">III. Multi-Universe Coordination&#39;s Myriad-Rank Representative System <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-multi-universe-coordination-s-myriad-rank-representative-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Multi-Universe Coordination&#39;s Myriad-Rank Representative System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Multiverse cultivator is not multi-universe&#39;s &quot;dictator.&quot; Per the republican axiom of Myriad Races, his stewardship must have Myriad-Rank representativeness:</p><ul><li>Each coordinated universe sends representatives, forming a &quot;Multi-Universe Myriad-Rank Council&quot;;</li><li>The Multiverse cultivator&#39;s every flow adjustment must be negotiated by the council;</li><li>The council has the right to veto any of his operations.</li></ul><p>This design turns &quot;stewardship&quot; from &quot;rule&quot; into &quot;coordination.&quot; In the old predatory-faction system, the Multiverse strong one is a &quot;cosmic emperor,&quot; destroys some universe at a whim; in Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the Multiverse cultivator is only a multi-universe coordinator, his authority comes from Myriad-Rank authorization.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-cosmic-annexation" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Cosmic Annexation&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-cosmic-annexation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Cosmic Annexation&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, a Multiverse strong one&#39;s typical behavior is &quot;annexing other universes&quot;: devouring weak universes&#39; origins, merging into his own. This behavior&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>The annexed universe&#39;s Myriad-Rank beings are uprooted, civilization extinct;</li><li>The annexer&#39;s origin is polluted by heterogeneous origin, must rupture later;</li><li>It trains &quot;devourers,&quot; not &quot;coordinators.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Multiverse acceleration gear does zero tolerance on &quot;origin annexation&quot;: once found, immediately cut cross-universe resonance, recover Multiverse permissions. This rule makes &quot;cosmic annexation&quot;彻底 lose on the time ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: distributed acceleration avoids a single universe dragged down too fast; parallel cap avoids consciousness splitting</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: origin annexation zero tolerance; multi-universe coordination must go through the Myriad-Rank Council</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Multiverse strong ones annex other universes as private property; Heng Yuan&#39;s Multiverse cultivator is a Myriad-Rank coordinator</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: each coordinated universe&#39;s Myriad Ranks has a representative seat; consciousness universe, mechanical universe also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: distributed acceleration algorithm, coordination council rules, approval process all public; this is the hyper-multiverse segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-exit-mechanism-for-multi-universe-coordination" tabindex="-1">VI. Exit Mechanism for Multi-Universe Coordination <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-exit-mechanism-for-multi-universe-coordination" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Exit Mechanism for Multi-Universe Coordination&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If some coordinated universe wishes to exit the Multiverse cultivator&#39;s coordination, he must unconditionally let go, may not apply any causal pressure. The exiting universe returns to fully autonomous state; the Alaya Network retains its historical records but no longer proactively connects. This exit mechanism ensures multi-universe coordination is voluntary cooperation, not a coerced federation. In the predatory-faction system, once the strong one takes a universe under his wing he never lets go; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s exit mechanism keeps coordination always based on consent.</p><h2 id="vii-cultural-fusion-of-multi-universe-coordination" tabindex="-1">VII. Cultural Fusion of Multi-Universe Coordination <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-cultural-fusion-of-multi-universe-coordination" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Cultural Fusion of Multi-Universe Coordination&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-universe coordination is not only resource and law coordination, but cultural fusion. The Multiverse cultivator periodically organizes cross-universe cultural-exchange events: let universe A&#39;s Myriad Ranks read universe B&#39;s epics, let universe C&#39;s technology be borrowed by universe D. This cultural fusion is supported by the Alaya Network&#39;s translation layer (see Entry 599). The deeper the cultural fusion, the more stable multi-universe coordination — because coordination is no longer just interest calculation, but mutual understanding between civilizations.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multiverse is the key realm from &quot;single universe&quot; to &quot;multi-universe.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain here does not give the &quot;steward&quot; unrestricted acceleration, but gives him a distributed tool for &quot;coordinating multiple universes&#39; rhythms.&quot; <strong>A true Multiverse strong one is not how many universes he can command, but how many universes are willing to resonate with him.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./575_模块3-加速域-本源境适配.html">575-Acceleration-Domain Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">80-Plane Theory and Classification</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{v as __pageData,m as default};
